      "claim": "Archaeological evidence shows several independent Neolithic cultures (e.g., Yangshao, Longshan, Liangzhu, Hongshan) developing complex societies across the Yellow River, Yangtze, and Northeast river basins between ~5000 and 2000 BCE.",
